      ],
      "source": "https://waypointwonder.com/what-to-see-and-do-in-rehovot-a-complete-guide-to-israels-science-city/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Rehovot’s citrus industry once made it a self‑sufficient town, with the first orchard planted by Swiss descendant Zalma Minkov’s husband.",
